OL,3,GNEWSA'Violent' man who strangled women
OL,4,Ain hotels jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "manipulative and violent" man has
OL,7,Fbeen jailed for more than seven years
OL,8,Ffor strangling, threatening to kill and
OL,9,Fassaulting women in hotel rooms.
OL,11,FTobias King, 36, who has previously
OL,12,Flived in Devon and Somerset, subjected
OL,13,Ftwo women to separate assaults in
OL,14,FHoniton, Devon, and Bournemouth,
OL,15,FDorset, which left them fearing for
OL,16,Ftheir lives, and sent woman multiple
OL,17,Funsolicited sexually explicit images.
