OL,3,GNEWSA'Violent' man who strangled women
OL,4,Ain hotels jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing, of no fixed abode, was jailed at
OL,7,FExeter Crown Court on Wednesday after
OL,8,Fadmitting strangulation, false
OL,9,Fimprisonment, threats to kill, actual
OL,10,Fbodily harm and theft.
OL,12,FDet Sgt Duncan Sandle, of Avon and
OL,13,FSomerset Police, called him a "a
OL,14,Fviolent and manipulative offender who
OL,15,Fis a danger to any woman".
